REASON
This page was written before the shared stylesheet existed, so it carried the whole design
system inline. Extracting it leaves one source of truth: the file drops from 376 lines to
218, and the remaining rules are only what is specific to this demo — the caret sizing,
the min-heights that stop the page shifting as text arrives, the playground grid, the
output stage, the directive mini-stages and the sequence cards.

No visual change was intended and none is expected: the extracted rules are the same
declarations, moved.

VERIFICATION
Every class the markup uses was accounted for against the two stylesheets. The module
suite (29 assertions) and the example string suite (30 assertions) were re-run unchanged,
and the page was served over HTTP.
